      "markdown": "## Derivative of a line\n\n•  $ y = mx + b $\n\n• slope m and y axis intercept b\n\n• derivative of  $ y = ax^{n} + b $ with respect to x:\n\n• dy/dx = a n x^{(n-1)}\n\n• Because $b$ is a constant -- think of it as $bx^{0}$ -- its derivative is $0bx^{-1} = 0$\n\n• For a straight line, a = m and n = 1 so\n\n• dy/dx = m 1  $ x^{(0)} $, or because  $ x^{0} = 1 $,\n\n• dy/dx = m",
